  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I just found out that the latest update broke the yt-dlp on the VRChat Client, making it so Audiolink on Avatars and Worlds in the SDK can't be used for Audiolink. Meaning we can't set up or test out Audiolink since the Client isn't reading the youtube links. And unfortinately I don't know how to fix this myself. This also means that the Furality Shaders for Somna, Sylvia, and Umbra do not work as well. This is affecting a lot of people who want to use audiolink in their worlds or avatars but can't. And some of us dont know unity that well. Please please fix this in the next update!!!!",
